# ── Stock background search ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# These two are client-exposed (see the VITE_ warning above), so they are only
# safe because they are free-tier, read-only, rate-limited stock-media search
# keys. Worst case if someone copies them out of the bundle is that they burn
# your rate limit -- there is no data or billing exposure.
#
# Leaving either one empty silently disables that provider's in-app search: the
# bundled cinematic themes and custom uploads keep working either way, which is
# why an empty value shows "no photos or videos" instead of an error.
#
# To make these genuinely private, proxy the calls through a server function and
# read the keys without the VITE_ prefix.
VITE_PIXABAY_API_KEY="56714652-e9448f02c43aadcd0501fd8e2"
VITE_PEXELS_API_KEY="lbV02U2COOBmyvC03Ie3kiA0xfI7V9KnJIGUQS9LGcIVqtxIxV7pKY9c"
